This port of Ping Wheel to Rust for Horizon is an exact 1:1 translation of the
upstream Java by LukenSkyne.

Upstream copyright (c) LukenSkyne, licensed under the MIT license:
Upstream mod page: https://modrinth.com/mod/ping-wheel

The Rust translation carries the same MIT license and credits the upstream
author in every translated file header.

